        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="num_205" playOrder="205" class="chapter">
          <navLabel>
            <text>Magnetic flux is the number of magnetic field lines passing through a given area Bracket OPEN Figure 5.3 bracket closed. It is denoted by phi and its unit is weber Bracket OPEN Wb bracket closed.</text>
          </navLabel>
          <content src="index_split_008.html#toc_id_197"/>
